OL,3,ABurnham and Badenoch clash at PMQs over
OL,4,Auniversity fees for EU students in UK
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndy Burnham and Kemi Badenoch clash
OL,7,Fover the government's new EU deal at
OL,8,FPMQs
OL,10,FBadenoch asks whether the deal is
OL,11,Fcontingent on ongoing talks about
OL,12,Flowering tuition fees paid by EU
OL,13,Fstudents in the UK
OL,15,FBurnham says the tuition fee agreement
OL,16,F"is not done" - citing the president of
OL,17,Fthe European Commission as saying "it's
OL,18,Fon a separate piece of paper" to the
OL,19,Fagreement on youth mobility, food
OL,20,Fexports and emissions trading
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
