OL,3,ABurnham and Badenoch clash at PMQs over
OL,4,Auniversity fees for EU students in UK
OL,5,
OL,6,FBadenoch says she will not repeat the
OL,7,Flyrics mimed in the video as they are
OL,8,F"so offensive" - our reporter, in the
OL,9,FCommons, says this could have been the
OL,10,Ffirst time some of these words had been
OL,11,Frecorded in Parliament's official
OL,12,Frecord, Hansard
OL,14,FBurnham says Badenoch is right to call
OL,15,Fthe language out "because it's not
OL,16,Facceptable" - but says he will not
OL,17,Fapologise for working with those who
OL,18,Freach younger people
